pan><span begin="23.242" end="23.899">thing</span> <span begin="23.899" end="24.101">just</span> <span begin="24.101" end="24.309">looks</span> <span begin="24.309" end="24.737">beau</span><span begin="24.737" end="24.921">ti</span><span begin="24.921" end="25.371">ful</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">一切皆美得令人心安</span></p><p begin="26.227" end="27.132" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.227" end="26.424">It&apos;s</span> <span begin="26.424" end="26.614">o</span><span begin="26.614" end="27.132">kay</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">无妨</span></p><p begin="28.114" end="30.832" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.114" end="28.304">The</span> <span begin="28.304" end="28.734">sun</span><span begin="28.734" end="29.127">shine</span> <span begin="29.127" end="29.782">keeps</span> <span begin="29.782" end="30.429">fal</span><span begin="30.429" end="30.832">ling</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">暖阳倾泻不息</span></p><p begin="32.959" end="38.880" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.959" end="33.137">Lone</span><span begin="33.137" end="33.377">li</span><span begin="33.377" end="34.009">ness</span> <span begin="34.627" end="34.827">does</span><span begin="34.827" end="35.054">n&apos;t</span> <span begin="35.054" end="36.494">stay</span> <span begin="36.494" end="37.215">for</span> <span begin="37.215" end="38.880">long</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">孤寂从不长驻</span></p><p begin="39.607" end="43.715" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.607" end="39.847">E</span><span begin="39.847" end="40.045">very</span><span begin="40.045" end="41.097">thing</span> <span begin="41.097" end="41.945">just</span> <span begin="41.945" end="42.785">looks</span> <span begin="42.785" end="43.217">beau</span><span begin="43.217" end="43.422">ti</span><span begin="43.422" end="43.715">ful</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">一切皆美得令人心安</span></p><p begin="48.685